ame="photoconsent" value="1"<?php echo $member['photoconsent']?' checked':'';?>> Let verified alumni see my profile photo</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="chatconsent" value="1"<?php echo $member['chatconsent']?' checked':'';?>> Let me use private alumni conversations</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="smsoptin" value="1"<?php echo $member['smsoptin']?' checked':'';?>> Receive AYISEC Alumni SMS updates</label><p><button name="save_profile">Save my settings</button><?php if($member['profileimage']){?> <button name="remove_photo" onclick="return confirm('Remove your profile photo?')">Remove my photo</button><?php }?></p></form></section></main><?php include('alumni-help-widget.php');?></body></html>
